<concept id="t00550">
	<title>Speeding warning</title>
	<conbody>
		<table colsep="1" frame="none" outputclass="formatc_none" rowsep="1" id="e03549">
			<tgroup cols="2" colsep="1" rowsep="1">
				<colspec colname="col1" colnum="1" colwidth="50*"/>
				<colspec colname="col2" colnum="2" colwidth="50*"/>
				<tbody>
					<row rowsep="1">
						<entry colname="col1">
							<fig id="e03550">
								<image href="images/N_SP327_C00_148.jpg" scale="95" align="center" placement="break"/>
							</fig>
						</entry>
						<entry colname="col2"/>
					</row>
				</tbody>
			</tgroup>
		</table>
		<p>When driving at a speed higher than the appearing speed limit, the red speed limit indicator blinks and a warning sounds.</p>
		<p>When the navigation system is applied, this is displayed when “Automatic Assist,” “Manual Assist,” or “Warning” is selected. When the navigation system is not applied, this is displayed when “Speed Limit Assist” or “Speed Limit Warning” is selected.</p>
	</conbody>
